  id: Alanthor_TradingOutpost
  displayName: Trading Outpost
  role: Trade post beside a resource node - trickles that node's resource without
    ever drawing on it
  description: Raise it beside any supply, iron or uncursed veilstone node (after
    Trade Charters) - it snaps to a free side (north, east, south or west), up to
    four posts per node, each further post there costing more to build. Pays while
    its node lives; stop the node's extractor before it runs dry.
